--------------------------------------------------
4. Privacy — no collection, no tracking
--------------------------------------------------
This tool does not collect, store, sell, or transmit personal data.
It does not use analytics, advertising pixels, tracking cookies, or
usage logs. Phone numbers, emails, URLs, uploaded images, and generated
files are processed only in the user's browser and are not sent to
A.RICH Software or to any third-party server by this tool.

The page may load the Heebo font from Google Fonts. That request does
not include form data, uploads, or generated files.

